  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 38948bbc0f96de7498bb32b64efae4ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: J1 - Mail 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Your role at CHERUB.
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: "As a member of the Nurturing Service, your goal will be to assist your
    siblings (that\u2019s your coworkers!) in giving the best of themselves in their
    work endeavours.\r\n\r\nAt CHERUB, each employee is tasked with providing a daily
    self-evaluation form about how well they would rank themselves across our six
    core company values, or H.E.A.L.T.H.\r\n\r\nAs you already know, these are the
    following:\r\n\r\n - Helpfulness\r\n\r\n - Empathy\r\n\r\n - Authenticity\r\n\r\n
    - Liveliness\r\n\r\n - Trust\r\n\r\n - Hope\r\n\r\nEvery day, you will be entrusted
    to follow and validate these forms by sorting them into specific categories,
    according to guidelines that you will progressively receive during the next few
    days.\r\n\r\nBeyond your 13th-floor colleagues, you will occasionally receive
    backlog from other floors to take care of as well. You will soon be delivered
    a first batch of backlog as a way to familiarize yourself with the sheets' format.
    \r\n\r\nToday, your only goal will be to ensure they properly match the template
    that will be transmitted shortly in a separate email. Tomorrow, your real work
    begins, and so does your bright new career!"
